  "slug": "inventory-count-proof-of-delivery-form",
  "title": "Inventory Count Proof of Delivery Form",
  "subtitle": "Authenticate the inventory count delivery through unit identity, custody events, recipient authority, location, timing, condition, and privacy-conscious proof.",
  "description": "An original, fillable inventory count proof of delivery form for controlling controlled physical inventory count and reconciliation package through proof of delivery identity, observations, evidence, decision, exceptions, escalation, completion, handoff, and final verification without replacing applicable requirements or professional review.",
  "use_case": "Use after a inventory count delivery or failed attempt when operations must establish what was delivered, to whom, where, when, under which control, and how any evidence gap or dispute was routed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
